              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Daniel K.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"Good prices, and the 14-day returns made me comfortable trying something new."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #0d9488;">PS</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Priya S.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"Exactly the kind of trending find I keep seeing — except here it was in stock and shipped fast."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #ea580c;">JR</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">James R.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"Arrived fast and actually works as described. Finally an online store that isn't just another random ad."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #7c3aed;">ML</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Maya L.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2: Right to Left (Reverse) -->
    <div class="testimonials-marquee-row">
      <div class="testimonials-marquee-track testimonials-marquee-track--reverse">
        {%- for i in (1..2) -%}
          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"The pet plug actually quieted our evenings. I'll be back for the rest of the house."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #2563eb;">SR</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Sofia R.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"Clean checkout, honest prices, and it showed up when they said it would. That's rare lately."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #0891b2;">BW</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Ben W.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"Bought it as a gift. It arrived fast and looked even better than the photos."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #f97316;">AM</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Aisha M.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-card">
            <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="testimonial-card__text">"The NÕX sinus relief works wonders from day one. I can breathe easily and sleep through the night without congestion."</p>
            <div class="testimonial-card__author">
              <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="background-color: #9333ea;">MK</div>
              <div class="testimonial-card__info">
                <p class="testimonial-card__name">Marcus K.</p>
                <p class="testimonial-card__badge">Verified buyer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials Marquee",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section section-testimonials-marquee",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "badge_text",
      "default": "VERIFIED REVIEWS",
      "label": "Badge Text"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "default": "Loved by shoppers worldwide",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "default": "Real orders. Real results. The reason people come back.",
      "label": "Subtitle"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background Color",
      "default": "#090f1f"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding Top",
      "default": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding Bottom",
      "default": 64
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Testimonials Marquee"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
